== Overview: overlap support and lower bound (direct enumeration) ==
PASS for every N<=10, M,n<=N: realisable overlaps = max(0,M+n-N)..min(M,n)
PASS a record (M,n,R) fits exactly the bags N >= M+n-R (checked N<20, M,n<8)
PASS fixing the first catch gives the same overlap distribution as random first catch (N<8)
PASS exact mean overlap equals M*n/N for every N<=12 (enumerated, not assumed)
PASS one object lies in C(N-1,n-1) of the C(N,n) second catches, fraction n/N

