== Live games (P1 both bands) with permanent letters A-X on the objects ==
If the keeper's hidden bag is letters A.. in order, the highest letter ever caught is a
lower bound that equals N whenever the last object turns up in any of the six catches.
  G23 N= 8: P(last letter caught in 3 rounds) = 0.984; expected distinct letters seen = 7.88
  G23 N=12: P(last letter caught in 3 rounds) = 0.912; expected distinct letters seen = 10.95
  G23 N=16: P(last letter caught in 3 rounds) = 0.822; expected distinct letters seen = 13.15
  G23 N=20: P(last letter caught in 3 rounds) = 0.738; expected distinct letters seen = 14.76
  G45 N=12: P(last letter caught in 3 rounds) = 0.984; expected distinct letters seen = 11.81
  G45 N=16: P(last letter caught in 3 rounds) = 0.940; expected distinct letters seen = 15.05
  G45 N=20: P(last letter caught in 3 rounds) = 0.882; expected distinct letters seen = 17.65
  G45 N=24: P(last letter caught in 3 rounds) = 0.822; expected distinct letters seen = 19.73
  (exact: P(an object misses one uniform k-catch) by enumeration, raised to the 6 independent catches)

